The demons you create by sacrifice will contribute to extinction, but
I'm quite sure you can always generate more. The exact distribution of
demons created is quite complicated. You can think of it as follows,
this is simplified: The relative probability if one for all demons
whose difficulty is at most the dungeon level. The relative
probability of the next difficult type is 1/2, the following one 1/4,
and so on (exponentially).

In conclusion, if you sacrifice kops in mine town or above Sokoban,
you will always get a fair share of foocubi.


